    "theorem": "FiniteCharThreeTraceAudit.finite_char_three_trace_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem finite_char_three_trace_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 3] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) [W.IsElliptic], (squareCompleted W).Δ=W.Δ ∧ Nonempty ((squareCompleted W).Point ≃+ W.Point) ∧ Nat.card (squareCompleted W).Point=Nat.card W.Point ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ (3:ℤ)∣fieldTrace W) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Nat.card W.Point%3=1) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ W.b₂=0) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ W.j=0) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W → Nat.card (ThreeTorsion W)=1)) ∧ (∀ (K L : Type) [Field K] [Field L] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] [DecidableEq L] [CharP K 3] [Algebra K L] [IsAlgClosed L] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) [W.IsElliptic], (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L))=1) ∧ (sourceSupersingular W ↔ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L))=0) ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L))=(if W.j=0 then 1 else 3) ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L))=(if W.j=0 then 0 else 1)) ∧ (∀ (K L : Type) [Field K] [Field L] [Fintype K] [Fintype L] [DecidableEq K] [DecidableEq L] [CharP K 3] [Algebra K L] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) [W.IsElliptic], sourceSupersingular (W.baseChange L) ↔ sourceSupersingular W) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 3], ∀ a b c d : K,(cubicModel a b c).Δ≠0 → a≠0 → ¬IsSquare d → (∃ P : (cubicModel a b c).Point,P≠0 ∧ (3:ℕ) • P=0) ∨ (∃ P : (twistModel a b c d).Point,P≠0 ∧ (3:ℕ) • P=0)) ∧ (ordinaryCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ ordinaryTwist.Δ≠0 ∧ ordinaryCurve.j=1 ∧ Nat.card ordinaryCurve.Point=5 ∧ Nat.card ordinaryTwist.Point=3 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion ordinaryCurve)=1 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion ordinaryTwist)=3 ∧ addOrderOf twistPoint=3 ∧ ¬sourceSupersingular ordinaryCurve ∧ ¬sourceSupersingular ordinaryTwist ∧ ¬(sourceSupersingular ordinaryCurve ↔ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion ordinaryCurve)=1)) ∧ (ssCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ ssTwist.Δ≠0 ∧ sourceSupersingular ssCurve ∧ sourceSupersingular ssTwist ∧ Nat.card ssCurve.Point=7 ∧ Nat.card ssTwist.Point=1 ∧ fieldTrace ssCurve= -3 ∧ fieldTrace ssTwist=3) ∧ (¬∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F3,W.Δ≠0 → sourceSupersingular W → fieldTrace W=0)",
    "decl_sha256": "704cd9c2be87970880419150026646117f4ab540f5137d7acfbcfc433e413778",
    "scope": "Everyfinitechar3field/no sizeordegreebound/everyactualnonsinggeneralWeierstrassmodel: exactsourcegcd(q+1-actualpointcard,q)!=1 iff3divactualtrace iffactualpointcardmod3one iffb2zeroiffjzero iffactualgeometric3torcard1iffactualgeometricZMod3rank0. Actualcomplete-squareu1shift(r0,s=-a1/2,t=-a3/2), Delta/actualAddEquiv/card/b2transport suppliesallgeneralmodels; sourceinvariantundereveryfinitefieldextension. Ordinarycubicfinitecube/Psi3abscissaandcomplementaryactualtwistfibersconstructnonzero3pointononepartner; actualCauchy/Lagrange/twist-sourceinvarianceexcludeordinarysourceSS. Speciala0bothpartnersno3torsionandcountsum2(q+1)/positiveq3powerforceNmod3one. No Hasse/trace-square/Endrank/basis/rank/rationalpoint/countpremise; no nonisomorphismassumption. Prioractualgroup/geometricj/module/countproofscredited. ActualordinaryF3#5/base3tor1/j1andtwist#3/rational3tor3/P(1,1)order3/sourcefalseboth, directrationalreplacementfalse; creditedsourceSS F3#7andtwist#1/traces-3/+3/directuniversaltracezero-strengtheningnegation. Sourcep>=5qualificationretained, no qualifiedembeddingtheoremrefutation. Generalp>=5trace-geometric/Hasse/Endrank/embedding/fulltorsionfield/other14gapsopen. No novelty/fullpaper-bookread/corpuspromotion/holes/customaxioms/nativeeval/raisedlimits/newglobalflags/waivers/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
